✅ 已調整：NULL 視為 0 來比對
推薦最終版本（NULL 轉 0）
-- 【最佳版本】找出 IsSARFiled 不一致的客戶（NULL 視為 0）
SELECT 
    a.CustomerNo,
    a.CIF_KEY,
    ISNULL(a.IsSARFiled, 0) AS BSA_IsSARFiled,
    ISNULL(b.IsSARFiled, 0) AS VERIFY_IsSARFiled,
    CASE 
        WHEN ISNULL(a.IsSARFiled, 0) = ISNULL(b.IsSARFiled, 0) THEN 'Match'
        ELSE 'DIFF'
    END AS Compare_Result
FROM BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT a
JOIN VERIFY..BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT b 
    ON a.cif_key = b.cif_key
WHERE EXISTS (
    SELECT 1 
    FROM CIF_Migrate_Mapping_TEMP c 
    WHERE a.CIF_KEY = c.NEW_CIF_KEY
)
AND ISNULL(a.IsSARFiled, 0) <> ISNULL(b.IsSARFiled, 0)   -- 只顯示不同的
ORDER BY a.CustomerNo;

其他實用版本
1. 統計版（看總共有幾筆不一致）
SELECT 
    COUNT(*) AS Total_Mismatch,
    SUM(CASE WHEN ISNULL(a.IsSARFiled, 0) = 1 AND ISNULL(b.IsSARFiled, 0) = 0 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS BSA_1_VERIFY_0,
    SUM(CASE WHEN ISNULL(a.IsSARFiled, 0) = 0 AND ISNULL(b.IsSARFiled, 0) = 1 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS BSA_0_VERIFY_1
FROM BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT a
JOIN VERIFY..BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT b ON a.cif_key = b.cif_key
WHERE EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM CIF_Migrate_Mapping_TEMP c WHERE a.CIF_KEY = c.NEW_CIF_KEY)
AND ISNULL(a.IsSARFiled, 0) <> ISNULL(b.IsSARFiled, 0);
2. 顯示全部共有客戶（含 Match / DIFF）
SELECT 
    a.CustomerNo,
    ISNULL(a.IsSARFiled, 0) AS BSA_IsSARFiled,
    ISNULL(b.IsSARFiled, 0) AS VERIFY_IsSARFiled,
    CASE 
        WHEN ISNULL(a.IsSARFiled, 0) = ISNULL(b.IsSARFiled, 0) THEN 'OK' 
        ELSE 'DIFF' 
    END AS Status
FROM BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT a
JOIN VERIFY..BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT b ON a.cif_key = b.cif_key
WHERE EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM CIF_Migrate_Mapping_TEMP c WHERE a.CIF_KEY = c.NEW_CIF_KEY)
ORDER BY Status DESC, a.CustomerNo;

重點說明：
	•	ISNULL(IsSARFiled, 0) 把 NULL 直接轉成 0 來比對。
	•	現在只要一邊是 NULL、另一邊是 0，也會視為相同（Match）。
	•	如果 VERIFY 是 1，但 BSA 是 NULL（或 0），就會被抓出來當作 DIFF。
